    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "The stochastic LLG equation is an atomistic spin-dynamics equation of motion augmented with a Langevin noise term for thermal fluctuations; it extends the deterministic LLG and belongs under emmo:AtomisticModel, while pm:SpinDynamicsConfiguration could hold its configuration parameters but does not represent the model itself."
  } ],
